# ---- Generated outputs ---------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/ and metadata/ ARE tracked: they are the source data.
# Everything below is regenerated by running the scripts. The generated
# filenames carry the species/drug pair, hence the wildcards.
data/normalized/*
data/logfc/*
data/compiled_rawdata*.csv
data/compiled_normdata*.csv
data/control_probe_QC*.csv
data/duplicate_lanes*.csv
figures/*
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/raw/RUNS.csv

# ---- Reference output ----------------------------------------------------
# One committed copy of the expected figure and its SPR table, so the README
# can show the result and anyone re-running has something to diff against.
# Regenerate with R/03_heatmap_spr.R and commit if the pipeline changes.
!figures/.gitkeep
!figures/albicansFluc_heatmap_SPR.svg
!figures/albicansFluc_heatmap_SPR.pdf
!figures/albicansFluc_heatmap_SPR_table.csv

# ---- R -------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
Rplots.pdf

# ---- OS ------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
